    "observed_identity": "Adult athletic moss-green poison frog herbalist. Exact rounded frog head and broad snout, large rounded amber eyes in their original proportions, mottled jade/olive skin with cream throat and belly, leaf collar, small worn brown botanical shoulder satchel with diagonal strap, teal cloth waist sash and hanging panels, dark teal/brown hand and forearm wraps, powerful frog thighs, long splayed frog toes.",
    "anatomy": "Preserve the same frog forearms, hands, toe number/shapes and strong hind-leg joints seen in the reference. Retain the leaf collar AND shoulder strap/satchel in every pose, even when partially occluded. No tail, ears, horns, external gills, human hair or new clothing. Do not turn Iria into an axolotl or a baby frog.",
    "transform": "Transformation uses only a slightly more alert stance, gently brighter existing amber eyes and subtle highlights in the EXISTING green skin pattern. No added spots, chest gem, plants growing from the body, new accessories or external poison clouds."
  },
